      "changes": [
        {
          "version": "0.1.0",
          "descriptionMd": "### Fetching of tags from specific APIs for specific resources\n\nNew tags collection means that new permissions are needed right now on top of existing ones:\n  - apigateway:GET\n  - autoscaling:DescribeAutoScalingGroups\n  - aps:ListWorkspaces\n  - dms:DescribeReplicationInstances\n  - dms:DescribeReplicationTasks\n  - ec2:DescribeTransitGatewayAttachments\n  - ec2:DescribeSpotFleetRequests\n  - storagegateway:ListGateways\n  - storagegateway:ListTagsForResource\n"
        },
        {
          "version": "0.11.0",
          "descriptionMd": "### Support for collecting metrics from multiple regions within a single integration\n\n#### Overview\nVersion 0.11.0 adds support for selecting multiple regions as a source of metrics.\n\n#### What's New\nThe region dropdown allows you to select multiple regions now.\n\n#### Upgrade Instructions\n- If you select additional regions during update, make sure that your role is allowed in all selected regions.\n"
        }
      ]
    }
